<section class="site-shell py-10 sm:py-14">
  <nav class="mb-8 text-xs text-gray-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/" class="text-link">home</a> / <a href="/showcase/" class="text-link">showcase</a> / moods</nav>
  <div class="grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
    <img src="/works/moods-cover.png" alt="Moods album cover" width="1254" height="1254" class="w-full max-w-[15rem] border border-white/10">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">instrumental album · proyogi baba</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-light text-white sm:text-5xl">Moods</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400">27 free instrumental background music tracks across nine emotions, made for narration, videos, reels and creative projects.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="{{ moods.download }}" class="button-primary">Download the album ↓</a></div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-6 text-gray-500">MP3 · ZIP includes the license · Music: <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="text-link">CC BY 4.0</a> · Created with AI and curated by Proyogi Baba.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="moods-player sticky top-16 z-40 border-y border-white/10 bg-black/95 backdrop-blur" data-moods-player>
  <div class="site-shell grid gap-2 py-3 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(18rem,1.3fr)] sm:items-center sm:gap-5">
    <div class="min-w-0"><p class="eyebrow text-retro-green">now playing</p><p class="truncate text-sm text-white" data-now-playing aria-live="polite">Select a track below</p></div>
    <audio controls preload="none" class="h-10 w-full" aria-label="Moods audio player" data-audio></audio>
    <p class="text-xs text-red-300 sm:col-span-2" data-player-error role="status" hidden>Playback failed. Please try again.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="site-shell pb-20 pt-12" aria-labelledby="tracks-heading">
  <h2 id="tracks-heading" class="section-heading">Explore the moods</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400">Choose a track to listen or download its MP3. The player stays with you as you scroll.</p>
  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    {% for group in moods.groups %}
    <section class="border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-5 sm:p-6" aria-labelledby="mood-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h3 id="mood-{{ loop.index }}" class="text-xl text-white">{{ group.mood }}</h3>
      <ol class="mt-4 divide-y divide-white/10">
        {% for track in group.tracks %}
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="flex min-h-14 min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3 py-2 text-left text-sm text-gray-300 hover:text-retro-green focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-retro-green" data-track-url="{{ track.url }}" data-track-title="{{ track.title }}" aria-label="Play {{ track.title }}" aria-pressed="false"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-retro-green" data-track-icon aria-hidden="true">▶</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-600">{{ track.id }}</span><span>{{ track.title }}</span></button><a href="{{ track.url }}" class="shrink-0 px-2 py-3 text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-retro-green focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-retro-green" aria-label="Download {{ track.title }} as MP3" data-track-download>Download ↓</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="site-shell pb-20" aria-labelledby="about-moods-heading">
  <div class="grid gap-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-10 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h2 id="about-moods-heading" class="text-xl font-light text-white">Background music for stories of every length</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400">From love and humour to courage, wonder and peace, Moods offers instrumental music for YouTube videos, YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, TikTok, podcasts and other storytelling projects. The tracks were created with narration in mind; choose the mood that supports your voice and adjust the music level in your edit.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400">Tracks were generated with a target of approximately 90 seconds. For 15-, 30- or 60-second videos, select an excerpt and add a fade where needed. For longer videos, repeat or transition between sections after checking that the join sounds right. Actual track lengths and endings vary.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-light text-white">Free to use with attribution</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400">Looking for no-copyright music? Moods is free to download and is offered under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="text-link">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)</a> for the rights held by the licensor. You may use and adapt the music in personal or commercial projects, including monetized videos, with appropriate credit and a license link where applicable. Indicate if you made changes.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-400">Suggested credit: Music: “[track title]” from <em>Moods</em> by Proyogi Baba · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="text-link">CC BY 4.0</a>. Mention any changes you make. The album ZIP also includes a license notice.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-6 text-gray-500">The license applies to the rights held by the licensor and does not guarantee against third-party claims. It does not cover the album artwork.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/moods-player.js" defer></script>
